8_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=H2MoHzknjXkQ7kNvwHWOqMD&_nc_oc=Adk3CDEo7iP6B2fLAGw6m3K4bEdyRjFUDI-6_6WPBkboWRX4kKYg6U0GwaS0ciNO8Hc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Afu7SiDjYkG4BbE65SFAM4GKgW9lKdfyNtth9Np_tBUq5w&oe=69A2F221"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Gravity League Cover Landscape.png", "id": "1219139702355137", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39003243_1219139705688470_1876740721875008590_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=95AlsQDJTToQ7kNvwHg5ZWL&_nc_oc=AdmfqlahMK-a8KfCjT2Hi-_GiZe2WoI3jiHaT8RG71fd04SbJszDBAErx4SCQsGMGl8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_AfuQy-cZ0_ouJsAvV-vsgwFuCygKf7RkvOMwSj0Ff3mZVw&oe=69A2F146"}, "display_name": "Gravity League", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Welcome to Gravity League - a brand new ball game!\n\nThe rules are simple - 2 players, 1 ball, no gravity - the first player to get 7 points is the winner!\n\nCompete with the best of the best and make your way to the top of the league to become a Gravity legend!\n\nUpgrade your gear in the Gravity store to enhance your abilities on the field - new gloves, balls and stadiums are waiting to be discovered.\n\n*** Early bird specials - \n- Launch discounted price!\n- Get 5,000 Gravity Coins on purchase!\n\nTo be the best, you have to beat the best.\n\nOnline League coming soon!", "short_description": "Welcome to Gravity League - a brand new ball game!\n\nThe rules are simple - 2 players, 1 ball, no gravity - the first player to get 7 points is the winner!\n\nCompete with the best of the best and make your way to the top of the league to become a Gravity legend!\n\n*** Early bird specials - \n- Launch discounted price!\n- Get 5,000 Gravity Coins on purchase!\n\nTo be the best, you have to beat the best.\n\nOnline League coming soon!"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://blue-duck-studios.com/privacy-policy", "developer_te